INSERT INTO `chat_config` VALUES (1082757131, 'about', 'about_en', '<p><strong class=\"ql-size-huge\">About Us</strong></p><p><span class=\"ql-cursor\">﻿</span>Welcome to Advandea, a dynamic and ambitious technology startup dedicated to empowering aspiring professionals in the strategy consulting industry. Founded by veterans of the strategy consulting world, our team brings deep expertise across various sectors and a shared belief in the transformative potential of AI. We’re here to harness that power, providing innovative solutions that bridge the gap between ambition and opportunity.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>At Advandea, we know that entering the strategy consulting industry is both challenging and rewarding. That’s why we built Interview Star. We focus on equipping future consultants with the tools they need to succeed, starting with the critical first step: the interview. By combining cutting-edge AI technology with industry insights, we offer personalized support to help users perfect their skills, sharpen their focus, and make a powerful impression in their journey to the top.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>We are committed to listening closely to our users, understanding their unique needs, and adapting our technology to offer them the most relevant, impactful tools. Interview Star&nbsp;is more than just an intelligent tool; it’s a partner in ambition, designed to grow and evolve with those who are determined to make their mark. Together, we’re redefining the path to success in the strategy consulting field, one interview at a time.</p><p><br></p>', '关于我们英文', 103, NULL, '', '1', '2024-11-25 10:53:57', NULL, NULL, '0', '192.168.245.1', 0);
INSERT INTO `chat_config` VALUES (1082757132, 'question', 'question_cn', '<p><strong class=\"ql-size-huge\">常见问题</strong></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><blockquote><strong class=\"ql-size-large\">问：谁应该使用面试星？</strong></blockquote><p>答：有准备战略咨询公司面试的求职者都适合使用面试星，包括大学本科、硕士和博士毕业生，MBA毕业生，以及已经在其他行业有工作经验但希望转入咨询行业的面试者。如果您对战略咨询行业感兴趣，但尚未进入面试流程，也可以通过面试星初步了解这个行业，为未来的机会做好准备。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><blockquote><strong class=\"ql-size-large\">问：面试星有什么功能？</strong></blockquote><p>答：面试星提供三大核心功能。第一，面试星可以模拟咨询案例分析，为用户提供丰富多样的真实案例，帮助用户通过与平台的全拟真互动练习提升能力。第二，面试星详细讲解战略咨询公司面试的各个要点，包括面试流程、考察重点以及需要的准备内容，帮助用户清晰了解面试要求。第三，面试星为用户提供数十家全球顶级战略咨询公司的介绍信息，方便用户更好地了解目标公司并针对性准备。。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><blockquote><strong class=\"ql-size-large\">问：面试星的核心优势是什么？</strong></blockquote><p>答：面试星的核心优势在于其创始团队和独特资源。面试星由具有世界顶级战略咨询公司丰富工作经验的专家创立，其团队成员既有面试者的亲身经验，也深谙面试官的考察思路。此外，面试星与多家著名战略咨询公司建立了合作关系，确保平台上的案例和信息贴近实际、全面准确且极具实用价值。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><blockquote><strong class=\"ql-size-large\">问：我如何使用面试星来准备咨询公司面试？</strong></blockquote><p>答：使用面试星的操作非常简单。您只需选择希望练习的方向或获取的信息内容，然后通过语音输入或文字输入与面试星进行自然语言交互即可开始练习和获取支持。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><blockquote><strong class=\"ql-size-large\">问：面试星的案例模拟数据库里有多少面试案例？</strong></blockquote><p>答：面试星的案例模拟数据库包括企业战略、业务利润、销售营销、成本控制、供应链管理、业务扩张等等十多个大类的案例，覆盖广泛的咨询主题。这些案例能够满足用户不同的练习需求，并且数据库会持续更新，不断增加新的案例以保持内容的前沿性和实用性。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><blockquote><strong class=\"ql-size-large\">问：我可以免费使用面试星吗？</strong></blockquote><p>答：任何人都可以免费注册面试星账户。普通用户每天可以免费与面试星对话十次。如果您需要更多使用次数，可以选择每月仅需29.9元人民币的高级会员计划，高级会员每天可享受多达100次的对话机会，极大地提升练习效率和覆盖面。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><blockquote><strong class=\"ql-size-large\">问：我可以和别人分享使用我的面试星账号吗？</strong></blockquote><p>答：每个面试星账号仅供注册用户本人使用。系统允许同一个网络（IP地址）下的两台设备同时登录。如果第三台设备或其他网络尝试登录同一个账号，系统将强制让之前登录的设备登出，以保护用户数据的安全性和账号的规范使用。</p>', '常见问题_中文', 103, NULL, '', '1', '2025-10-31 11:51:35', NULL, NULL, '0', '192.168.245.1', 0);
INSERT INTO `chat_config` VALUES (1082757133, 'question', 'question_en', '<p><strong class=\"ql-size-huge\">FAQ</strong></p><p><br></p><p><br></p><blockquote><span class=\"ql-size-large\">Q: Who should use Interview&nbsp;Star?</span></blockquote><p>A: Interview&nbsp;Star is designed for anyone preparing for strategy consulting firm interviews. This includes undergraduates, master’s and PhD graduates, MBA students, as well as professionals with experience in other industries who are looking to transition into consulting. Even if you are just curious about the strategy consulting industry and have not yet entered the interview process, Interview&nbsp;Star can help you gain a solid understanding of the field and prepare for future opportunities.</p><p><span class=\"ql-size-large\">&nbsp;</span></p><blockquote><span class=\"ql-size-large\">Q: What features does Interview&nbsp;Star offer?</span></blockquote><p>A: Interview&nbsp;Star offers three main features. First, it provides realistic case simulations with a rich library of consulting scenarios, enabling users to practice interactively with the platform. Second, it offers comprehensive explanations of consulting interview essentials, including detailed insights into interview processes, assessment criteria, and preparation tips. Third, it provides in-depth information on dozens of the world’s top strategy consulting firms, helping users better understand their target companies and tailor their preparation accordingly.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><blockquote><span class=\"ql-size-large\">Q: What are the core advantages of Interview&nbsp;Star?</span></blockquote><p>A: Interview&nbsp;Star’s core advantages lie in its expert-led foundation and unique resources. The platform was created by a team of seasoned professionals with extensive experience in top-tier strategy consulting firms, bringing both the perspective of interviewees and the insights of interviewers. Additionally, Interview&nbsp;Star has established partnerships with several leading consulting firms to ensure that its case database is realistic, diverse, and highly practical, while its interview preparation resources are accurate, comprehensive, and effective.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><blockquote><span class=\"ql-size-large\">Q: How can I use Interview&nbsp;Star to prepare for consulting interviews?</span></blockquote><p>A: Using Interview&nbsp;Star is straightforward. Simply select the area you want to focus on—whether it’s practicing cases or learning about specific consulting firms—and engage in a natural language conversation with the platform through text or voice input.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><blockquote><span class=\"ql-size-large\">Q: How many cases are available in Interview&nbsp;Star’s simulation database?</span></blockquote><p>A: Interview&nbsp;Star’s simulation database includes a wide variety of cases, covering over ten categories such as corporate strategy, profitability analysis, marketing and sales, cost control, supply chain management,&nbsp;business expansion, etc.. The database is continuously updated with new cases, ensuring users always have access to fresh and relevant content for their practice.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><blockquote><span class=\"ql-size-large\">Q: Can I use Interview&nbsp;Star for free?</span></blockquote><p>A: Yes, anyone can register for Interview&nbsp;Star for free. Free users can interact with the platform up to ten times per day. For those who need more extensive practice, the premium membership plan is available for just USD 19.9 per month, allowing up to 100 interactions per day to maximize preparation.</p><p><br></p><blockquote><span class=\"ql-size-large\">Q: Can I share my Interview&nbsp;Star account with others?</span></blockquote><p>A: Each Interview&nbsp;Star account is intended for individual use only. The system allows up to two devices on the same network (IP address) to log in simultaneously. If a third device or a device from a different network attempts to log in, the system will automatically log out the previously connected devices to ensure account security and proper usage.</p>', '常见问题_英文', 103, NULL, '', '1', '2025-10-31 11:51:36', NULL, NULL, '0', '192.168.245.1', 0);
